{"id": "sfcta-design-contracts-grow-after-award", "title": "Transportation Authority design contracts: few bidders, then several times the price", "seconds": 174.0, "voice": "elevenlabs:iPYqcpY8j8Ap4jUf28I3", "narrator": "Michael", "tempo": 1.2, "made": "2026-11-24", "key": "db42697fb5059c1c", "words": 418, "beats": [{"scene": "open", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "timeline[0]"], "text": "2010. The Transportation Authority hires WMH Corporation to design the west-side bridges.", "t0": 0.2, "t1": 6.26, "shot": "b0", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "calendar", "label": "2010", "kicker": "West-side bridges design", "sub": "awarded to WMH Corporation: $1,600,000"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.25, 0.79, 1.63, 2.23, 2.65, 3.14, 3.64, 4.32, 4.5, 4.8, 4.91, 5.38]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "timeline[0]"], "text": "The price: 1.6 million dollars.", "t0": 6.38, "t1": 9.53, "shot": "b0", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "calendar", "label": "2010", "kicker": "West-side bridges design", "sub": "awarded to WMH Corporation: $1,600,000"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.09, 0.68, 1.13, 1.49, 1.82, 2.41]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "timeline[0]"], "text": "By 2023, what had it grown to?", "t0": 9.53, "t1": 12.18, "shot": "b0", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "calendar", "label": "2010", "kicker": "West-side bridges design", "sub": "awarded to WMH Corporation: $1,600,000"}, "wt": [0.04, 0.57, 0.83, 1.49, 1.61, 1.71, 1.84, 2.15]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[0].what", "timeline[3]", "established[0]"], "text": "17.8 million. 11 times over.", "t0": 12.18, "t1": 17.0, "shot": "b1", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$17.8 million", "label": "the bridges design contract, 2023", "sub": "11.11 times its award"}, "emph": ["17.8 million"], "wt": [0.04, 1.03, 1.5, 1.69, 2.64, 3.7, 4.22]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["established[0]"], "text": "Then, in 2025, 200,000 dollars more.", "t0": 17.52, "t1": 21.01, "shot": "b1r", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$18,120,000", "label": "the bridges design contract, September 2025", "sub": "11.3 times the 2010 award"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.24, 0.31, 0.53, 1.85, 1.98, 2.25, 2.59, 2.97]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "caveat", "ref": ["caveat"], "text": "This is a lead, not a finding.", "t0": 21.13, "t1": 23.07, "shot": "b2", "visual": {"type": "caveat", "line": "This is a lead, not a finding: a pattern in public records. This film says what the records show, what they do not show, and what would settle it."}, "wt": [0.0, 0.1, 0.18, 0.3, 1.04, 1.18, 1.28]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["story[0]", "actors[0]"], "text": "The Authority runs the City’s transportation sales tax. Its board is the Board of Supervisors.", "t0": 23.19, "t1": 28.76, "shot": "b3", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "cityhall", "label": "San Francisco County Transportation Authority", "kicker": "Who buys", "sub": "its board is the Board of Supervisors"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.11, 0.6, 0.88, 0.99, 1.31, 1.92, 2.32, 3.02, 3.53, 4.0, 4.28, 4.37, 4.58, 4.71]}, {"scene": "lead1", "kind": "rank", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "The first lead. Three WMH design contracts started at 5.5 million dollars together.", "t0": 28.98, "t1": 35.75, "shot": "b4", "visual": {"type": "rank", "label": "WMH Corporation design contracts after amendments, millions of dollars", "rows": [["West-side bridges, 2010 to 2023", "17.8"], ["Hillcrest Road", "3.8"], ["Island path", "3.4"]]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.1, 0.6, 1.29, 2.45, 2.95, 3.35, 3.94, 4.32, 4.43, 4.77, 5.2, 5.42, 5.88, 6.27]}, {"scene": "lead1", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[0].what", "amount"], "text": "After amendments: 25.3 million.", "t0": 35.87, "t1": 39.11, "shot": "b5", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$25.3 million", "label": "after amendments", "sub": "three WMH Corporation design contracts"}, "emph": ["25.3 million"], "wt": [0.0, 0.28, 0.86, 1.79, 2.27, 2.53]}, {"scene": "lead1", "kind": "versus", "ref": ["suspicious[0].what", "timeline[1]", "timeline[4]", "timeline[5]"], "text": "Hillcrest Road, 2.7 million to 3.8.", "t0": 39.63, "t1": 43.04, "shot": "b6", "visual": {"type": "versus", "a": ["Hillcrest Road design", "$2.7 million to $3.8 million"], "b": ["Island path design", "$1.1 million to $3.4 million"]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.41, 1.23, 1.33, 1.64, 1.86, 2.3, 2.51, 2.73, 3.03]}, {"scene": "lead1", "kind": "versus", "ref": ["suspicious[0].what", "timeline[1]", "timeline[4]", "timeline[5]"], "text": "The island path, 1.1 to 3.4, within two years.", "t0": 43.16, "t1": 48.45, "shot": "b6x", "visual": {"type": "versus", "a": ["Hillcrest Road design", "$2.7 million to $3.8 million"], "b": ["Island path design", "$1.1 million to $3.4 million"]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.12, 0.57, 1.42, 1.53, 1.9, 2.13, 2.42, 2.6, 2.97, 4.06, 4.45, 4.68]}, {"scene": "lead1", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["established[6]", "innocent[3]"], "text": "But 1,500,000 dollars of the path’s growth was announced with the first award.", "t0": 48.57, "t1": 53.91, "shot": "b6y", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "staff will return to the Board to amend the WMH contract to final design for a total of $2,650,000"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.11, 0.4, 0.66, 1.0, 1.34, 1.92, 2.36, 2.42, 2.53, 2.94, 3.48, 3.78, 4.23, 4.35, 4.46, 4.81]}, {"scene": "lead1", "kind": "versus", "ref": ["suspicious[0].what", "actors[3]"], "text": "The bridges’ construction manager,", "t0": 54.03, "t1": 55.6, "shot": "b7", "visual": {"type": "versus", "a": ["WSP USA Inc., bridges construction management", "$5.5 million"], "b": ["After amendments", "$11.5 million"]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.03, 0.42, 0.91]}, {"scene": "lead1", "kind": "versus", "ref": ["suspicious[0].what", "actors[3]"], "text": "WSP, doubled too: 5.5 million to 11.5.", "t0": 55.6, "t1": 60.25, "shot": "b7", "visual": {"type": "versus", "a": ["WSP USA Inc., bridges construction management", "$5.5 million"], "b": ["After amendments", "$11.5 million"]}, "emph": ["doubled"], "wt": [0.04, 0.65, 1.01, 1.78, 2.01, 2.37, 2.55, 3.18, 3.45, 3.82, 4.26]}, {"scene": "lead1", "kind": "versus", "ref": ["story[1]", "links[1]", "timeline[6]"], "text": "In September 2025 it rose again, to 12.2 million.", "t0": 60.37, "t1": 65.05, "shot": "b7w", "visual": {"type": "versus", "a": ["After amendments", "$11.5 million"], "b": ["September 2025", "$12.2 million"]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.11, 0.57, 0.83, 1.42, 1.65, 1.94, 2.6, 2.91, 3.28, 3.72, 3.96]}, {"scene": "lead1", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[0].why", "notEstablished[0]"], "text": "Were the later phases ever priced against another firm? The record doesn’t say.", "t0": 65.17, "t1": 69.81, "shot": "b8", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "whether the later phases were ever priced against another firm"}, "emph": ["another firm"], "wt": [0.0, 0.06, 0.19, 0.44, 0.93, 1.18, 1.74, 2.13, 2.44, 3.38, 3.49, 3.86, 4.24]}, {"scene": "lead2", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "The second lead. 19 award memos are on file. How many drew two offers or fewer?", "t0": 70.03, "t1": 76.39, "shot": "b9", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "contract", "label": "19 award memos, 2014 to 2026", "kicker": "The second lead", "sub": "how many offers each drew"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.07, 0.55, 1.07, 2.2, 2.52, 2.84, 2.98, 3.15, 3.62, 3.93, 4.21, 4.56, 4.88, 5.45, 5.74]}, {"scene": "lead2", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[1].what"], "text": "8.", "t0": 76.39, "t1": 77.85, "shot": "b10", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "8", "label": "of 19 awards drew two offers or fewer", "sub": "$31.0 million together"}, "emph": ["8"], "wt": [0.04]}, {"scene": "lead2", "kind": "count", "ref": ["established[4]", "suspicious[1].what", "notEstablished[5]"], "text": "And a fourth WMH contract, in 2021,", "t0": 78.37, "t1": 81.78, "shot": "b10b", "visual": {"type": "count", "value": "$1,700,000", "label": "a fourth WMH contract, April 2021: two proposals", "sub": "with it, 9 of 20 award papers drew two offers or fewer, $32.7 million"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.14, 0.26, 0.72, 1.27, 2.05, 2.17, 2.39]}, {"scene": "lead2", "kind": "count", "ref": ["established[4]", "suspicious[1].what", "notEstablished[5]"], "text": "up to 1,700,000 dollars, drew two proposals too.", "t0": 81.78, "t1": 86.24, "shot": "b10b", "visual": {"type": "count", "value": "$1,700,000", "label": "a fourth WMH contract, April 2021: two proposals", "sub": "with it, 9 of 20 award papers drew two offers or fewer, $32.7 million"}, "wt": [0.04, 0.17, 0.32, 0.65, 0.86, 1.23, 1.45, 1.92, 2.5, 2.98, 3.2, 3.95]}, {"scene": "lead2", "kind": "rank", "ref": ["suspicious[1].what"], "text": "Among them, the 22.1 million Hillcrest Road construction contract: two bids.", "t0": 86.36, "t1": 91.92, "shot": "b11", "visual": {"type": "rank", "label": "Short fields, millions of dollars", "rows": [["Hillcrest Road construction, two bids, 2024", "22.1"], ["Island path design, two proposals, 2024", "4.35"], ["state lobbying, one bid, 2015", "0.135"]]}, "emph": ["22.1 million"], "wt": [0.0, 0.29, 0.67, 0.82, 1.82, 2.23, 2.76, 3.01, 3.57, 4.34, 4.95]}, {"scene": "lead2", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["established[1]"], "text": "And the Hillcrest Road design award to WMH? One proposal.", "t0": 92.04, "t1": 95.92, "shot": "b11h", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "contract", "label": "Hillcrest Road design", "kicker": "The second lead", "sub": "awarded to WMH Corporation, May 2022: one proposal", "chip": "$2,700,000"}, "emph": ["One proposal"], "wt": [0.0, 0.08, 0.17, 0.57, 0.78, 1.13, 1.51, 1.73, 3.03, 3.2]}, {"scene": "lead2", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[1].why"], "text": "A two-offer field sets the starting price.", "t0": 96.04, "t1": 98.37, "shot": "b12", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "every later amendment is negotiated with the firm already holding the work"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.12, 0.67, 1.07, 1.35, 1.44, 1.79]}, {"scene": "lead2", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[1].why"], "text": "Every amendment after that is negotiated with the firm already holding the work.", "t0": 98.49, "t1": 102.97, "shot": "b12", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "every later amendment is negotiated with the firm already holding the work"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.25, 0.73, 1.06, 1.36, 1.59, 2.1, 2.24, 2.43, 2.86, 3.31, 3.62, 3.74]}, {"scene": "lead2", "kind": "versus", "ref": ["suspicious[1].what", "innocent[1]"], "text": "Others drew many: 43 statements for an on-call engineering list.", "t0": 103.09, "t1": 107.48, "shot": "b13", "visual": {"type": "versus", "a": ["On-call engineering list", "43 statements"], "b": ["Website", "31 proposals"], "kicker": "Others drew many"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.38, 0.72, 1.63, 2.16, 2.62, 2.74, 2.85, 3.36, 3.93]}, {"scene": "lead3", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "suspicious[2].why"], "text": "The third lead. Proposition L is the sales tax the Authority administers.", "t0": 107.7, "t1": 112.82, "shot": "b14", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "money", "label": "Yes on L", "kicker": "The third lead", "sub": "Better Roads and Transit, 2022"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.11, 0.52, 1.01, 2.31, 2.62, 2.86, 2.97, 3.39, 3.67, 3.82, 4.28]}, {"scene": "lead3", "kind": "chain", "ref": ["suspicious[2].what", "timeline[1]", "timeline[2]"], "text": "In 2022, the Board gave WMH the 2.7 million dollar Hillcrest design.", "t0": 112.94, "t1": 119.04, "shot": "b15", "visual": {"type": "chain", "steps": [{"art": "contract", "name": "The award", "sub": "Hillcrest design to WMH, $2.7 million"}, {"art": "money", "name": "3 June 2022", "sub": "WMH gives $10,000 to Yes on L"}], "kicker": "One month apart"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.08, 0.41, 1.4, 1.55, 1.81, 2.15, 2.77, 3.0, 3.18, 3.6, 3.84, 4.36, 4.81, 5.57]}, {"scene": "lead3", "kind": "chain", "ref": ["suspicious[2].what", "timeline[1]", "timeline[2]"], "text": "The next month?", "t0": 119.16, "t1": 120.29, "shot": "b15", "visual": {"type": "chain", "steps": [{"art": "contract", "name": "The award", "sub": "Hillcrest design to WMH, $2.7 million"}, {"art": "money", "name": "3 June 2022", "sub": "WMH gives $10,000 to Yes on L"}], "kicker": "One month apart"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.08, 0.42]}, {"scene": "lead3", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[2].what", "timeline[2]"], "text": "WMH gave 10,000 dollars to the Yes on L committee.", "t0": 120.29, "t1": 124.19, "shot": "b16", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$10,000", "label": "WMH Corporation to Yes on L", "sub": "3 June 2022"}, "emph": ["10,000"], "wt": [0.04, 0.99, 1.22, 1.47, 1.95, 2.46, 2.57, 2.68, 2.95, 3.22, 3.4]}, {"scene": "lead3", "kind": "rank", "ref": ["suspicious[2].what", "established[2]"], "text": "It wasn’t alone.", "t0": 124.61, "t1": 126.02, "shot": "b17", "visual": {"type": "rank", "label": "Firms in the award memos that gave to Yes on L, dollars", "rows": [["AECOM", "35000"], ["Arup", "25000"], ["HNTB Corporation", "25000"], ["WSP USA Inc.", "20000"], ["WMH Corporation", "10000"]]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.17, 0.48]}, {"scene": "lead3", "kind": "rank", "ref": ["suspicious[2].what", "established[2]"], "text": "8 firms from the award memos gave 132,500 dollars together.", "t0": 126.02, "t1": 131.63, "shot": "b17", "visual": {"type": "rank", "label": "Firms in the award memos that gave to Yes on L, dollars", "rows": [["AECOM", "35000"], ["Arup", "25000"], ["HNTB Corporation", "25000"], ["WSP USA Inc.", "20000"], ["WMH Corporation", "10000"]]}, "wt": [0.04, 0.52, 0.88, 1.01, 1.11, 1.46, 1.9, 2.11, 2.29, 2.57, 3.0, 3.78, 4.29, 4.58, 5.04]}, {"scene": "lead3", "kind": "versus", "ref": ["established[5]", "notEstablished[4]"], "text": "Forms on four firms name the Authority.", "t0": 131.75, "t1": 134.46, "shot": "b17b", "visual": {"type": "versus", "kicker": "Is the donor the contractor?", "a": ["forms name the Authority", "WMH, WSP, TY Lin, HNTB"], "b": ["the name alone", "Arup, AECOM, Nossaman, DeSilva Gates"], "arrows": false}, "wt": [0.0, 0.4, 0.61, 1.01, 1.48, 1.86, 2.12]}, {"scene": "lead3", "kind": "versus", "ref": ["established[5]", "notEstablished[4]"], "text": "For Arup, AECOM, Nossaman, DeSilva Gates: the name alone.", "t0": 134.58, "t1": 140.38, "shot": "b17b", "visual": {"type": "versus", "kicker": "Is the donor the contractor?", "a": ["forms name the Authority", "WMH, WSP, TY Lin, HNTB"], "b": ["the name alone", "Arup, AECOM, Nossaman, DeSilva Gates"], "arrows": false}, "wt": [0.0, 0.21, 0.79, 1.82, 2.79, 3.2, 4.22, 4.66, 5.03]}, {"scene": "lead3", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[2].why", "innocent[2]", "notEstablished[3]"], "text": "A ballot-measure gift isn’t a gift to any official. The order of events is the question.", "t0": 140.5, "t1": 145.45, "shot": "b18", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "is not a gift to any official"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.11, 0.73, 1.05, 1.3, 1.41, 1.78, 1.9, 2.06, 2.8, 3.24, 3.51, 3.67, 4.13, 4.28, 4.39]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["established[3]"], "text": "The Authority’s 11 audits on file report no findings.", "t0": 145.67, "t1": 149.44, "shot": "b19", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "gavel", "label": "11 audits, no findings", "sub": "fiscal 2014 to 2025"}, "emph": ["no findings"], "wt": [0.0, 0.07, 0.61, 1.01, 1.4, 1.58, 2.04, 2.71, 3.1]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["innocent[0]", "story[4]"], "text": "And the memos blame a re-scoping when Caltrans changed the funding plan.", "t0": 149.56, "t1": 153.93, "shot": "b19", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "gavel", "label": "11 audits, no findings", "sub": "fiscal 2014 to 2025"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.04, 0.14, 0.55, 0.92, 1.16, 2.22, 2.57, 3.19, 3.44, 3.53, 3.92]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "unknowns", "ref": ["notEstablished[0]", "notEstablished[2]", "notEstablished[3]"], "text": "Nothing shows a link between the gift and an award, or how the short fields were scored.", "t0": 154.05, "t1": 159.12, "shot": "b20", "visual": {"type": "unknowns", "cards": ["Whether later phases were priced against another firm", "Who scored the two-proposal awards", "Any link between the gift and an award"]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.3, 0.5, 0.6, 0.91, 1.22, 1.36, 1.8, 2.04, 2.21, 3.18, 3.3, 3.42, 3.51, 3.81, 4.29, 4.48]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "settle", "ref": ["next[0]", "next[2]"], "text": "What would settle it? The contract register with every amendment, and the scoring sheets.", "t0": 159.24, "t1": 164.83, "shot": "b21", "visual": {"type": "settle", "cards": [{"who": "", "what": "The Authority’s contract register with every amendment"}, {"who": "", "what": "Scoring sheets for the two-proposal awards"}], "focus": 0}, "wt": [0.0, 0.07, 0.23, 0.56, 1.23, 1.64, 2.18, 2.81, 3.23, 3.49, 4.4, 4.46, 4.58, 5.11]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "status", "ref": ["status", "defense[0]"], "text": "Every amendment was approved by the Authority’s board. Nothing here alleges misconduct.", "t0": 164.95, "t1": 170.51, "shot": "b22", "visual": {"type": "status"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.26, 0.71, 0.87, 1.39, 1.49, 1.58, 2.09, 2.69, 3.81, 4.16, 4.81]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "end", "ref": ["end"], "text": "A lead is a question, not an accusation.", "t0": 170.63, "t1": 173.15, "shot": "b23", "visual": {"type": "end"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.08, 0.37, 0.44, 0.54, 1.23, 1.62, 1.78]}], "format": 6, "chapters": {"open": "The bridges", "lead1": "Lead 1 · $5.5 million to $25.3 million", "lead2": "Lead 2 · two offers or fewer", "lead3": "Lead 3 · a month later", "close": "Where it stands"}, "look": "flow", "hook": "timeline"}